      "blue": "Shield single Hornet: hot start on Stennis, six AIM-120C, two AIM-9X and centreline tank. Control 251 AM; probe-and-drogue Texaco 253 AM. Raid One is active at mission start; Raid Two activates at 300 seconds. This is aircraft interception: destroying launched missiles is not scored. The escort may engage independently. No carrier ATC, ICLS, TACAN, deck-slot plan or moving-deck recovery waypoint is configured."
